# What this module vendors from yadgarhq/proto (D70), at the SAME tag `project`
# and `iam` vendor (PROTO_VERSION). The seeder is a CLIENT of ProjectService,
# declared in yadgar/project/v1/project.proto, and of IamService (SyncTeams),
# declared in yadgar/iam/v1/iam.proto; buf closes the import graph, so this also
# brings yadgar/common/v1 and yadgar/telemetry/v1. Moving PROTO_VERSION ahead of
# `project`'s or `iam`'s would let the seeder set a field they do not know, and
# prost drops an unknown field silently (see `src/sync.rs`).
yadgar/project/v1
yadgar/iam/v1
